  "caveats": ["Affected Storybook development preview can permit project-file changes from a malicious website; subsequent local execution needs additional conditions. Built static Storybook and unopened headless dev servers are excluded. Maintainer says no known exploitation, which is not proof of absence.", "Developer public advisory and fixed Reviewed record compared. Maintainer exact inclusive affected maxima and database exclusive fixed boundaries remain separately preserved in the linked audit; no untested intermediate version is inferred.", "Database and maintainer publication/modification dates and severity assessments are separately attributed. Exploitation and KEV remain unknown; no exploit was executed."],
